{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Working Class Monsters</strong> is an <strong>ultra-casual</strong> short incremental game where you must make gold to rebuild the monster kingdom.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086870/extras/0b9e57ba7952d4dd34b676508daa9700.poster.avif?t=1774525978\" width=782 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086870/extras/0b9e57ba7952d4dd34b676508daa9700.webm?t=1774525978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086870/extras/0b9e57ba7952d4dd34b676508daa9700.mp4?t=1774525978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's no failure</strong>\u00a0or<strong> punishment</strong> in this game. Every interaction progresses you further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs, place workers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy - there's no way to fail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interaction means progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have freedom to strategize and refine your gold making approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loads of monsters to find in packs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086870/extras/eb36a79c5bd6a50fd2f260d8b4554c2e.poster.avif?t=1774525978\" width=770 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086870/extras/eb36a79c5bd6a50fd2f260d8b4554c2e.webm?t=1774525978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.